number` and `extension_number`. `current_phone_number` announces the captured callback number; `extension_number` announces the captured extension.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"maxLength":36,"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed values: `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"current_phone_number","default":"current_phone_number","enum":["current_phone_number","extension_number"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"Extension-collection prompts."},"advanced_callback_confirmation":{"type":"object","properties":{"advanced_confirm_message":{"type":"object","properties":{"key_press":{"type":"string","description":"Keypress the consumer must press."},"message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"TTS message text. Honored when `callback_audio_type=text_to_speech`."},"custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose allowed dynamic variables are `current_phone_number` (captured callback number) and `keypress` (active keypress).","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed values: `current_phone_number`, `keypress`.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"current_phone_number","default":"current_phone_number","enum":["current_phone_number","keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `current_phone_number`, `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"An interactive prompt in the advanced callback confirmation flow. The consumer presses a key — `key_press` — to take an action, while the runtime plays back dynamic data such as the captured phone number. The `custom_audio` ref permits advanced custom audio with `audio_variable` restricted to `current_phone_number` or `keypress`."},"advanced_confirm_message_with_extension_prompt":{"type":"object","properties":{"key_press":{"type":"string","description":"Keypress the consumer must press."},"message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"TTS message text. Honored when `callback_audio_type=text_to_speech`."},"custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose allowed dynamic variables are `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`, and `keypress`. `current_phone_number` announces the captured callback number; `extension_number` announces the captured extension; `keypress` announces the active keypress.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"maxLength":36,"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed values: `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`, `keypress`.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"current_phone_number","default":"current_phone_number","enum":["current_phone_number","extension_number","keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`, `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"An interactive prompt in the advanced callback confirmation flow with extension prompts. The consumer presses a key — `key_press` — to take an action, while the runtime plays back dynamic data such as the captured phone or extension number. The `custom_audio` ref permits advanced custom audio with `audio_variable` restricted to `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`, or `keypress`."},"greeting_setting":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"TTS message text. Honored when `callback_audio_type=text_to_speech`."},"custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."}},"description":"A static announcement in the advanced callback confirmation flow, played at a fixed point in the voice-message recording sub-flow — greeting, end, listen / save / re-record control, too-short notice, or save confirmation. `key_press` and `action` are hardcoded server-side and therefore not part of the wire shape; see the parent sub-object name for the runtime semantics. `custom_audio` is restricted to the `standard` type, with no dynamic-variable substitution."},"end_setting":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"maxLen