 part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose only allowed dynamic variable is `keypress` (announces the active keypress to the consumer).\n\nIn `advanced` mode, each item must specify either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable` (not both); up to 7 items per prompt.\nIn `standard` mode, supply a single item with `audio_asset_id` only.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed value: `keypress` — announces the active keypress.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"keypress","default":"keypress","enum":["keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"Menu keypress option for the AMD person-answered accept-menu."}},"is_repeat_option":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the repeat-the-menu keypress is offered. MUST be consistent across all language containers (default + every i18n entry); divergent values return HTTP 