dvanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose allowed dynamic variables are `current_phone_number` (captured callback number) and `keypress` (active keypress).","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed values: `current_phone_number`, `keypress`.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"current_phone_number","default":"current_phone_number","enum":["current_phone_number","keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `current_phone_number`, `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"An interactive prompt in the advanced callback confirmation flow. The consumer presses a key — `key_press` — to take an action, while the runtime plays back dynamic data such as the captured phone number. The `custom_audio` ref permits advanced custom audio with `audio_variable` restricted to `current_phone_number` or `keypress`."},"advanced_confirm_message_with_extension_prompt":{"type":"object","properties":{"key_press":{"type":"string","description":