lt":"current_phone_number","enum":["current_phone_number","keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `current_phone_number`, `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"An interactive prompt in the advanced callback confirmation flow. The consumer presses a key — `key_press` — to take an action, while the runtime plays back dynamic data such as the captured phone number. The `custom_audio` ref permits advanced custom audio with `audio_variable` restricted to `current_phone_number` or `keypress`."},"advanced_confirm_message_with_extension_prompt":{"type":"object","properties":{"key_press":{"type":"string","description":"Keypress the consumer must press."},"message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"TTS message text. Honored when `callback_audio_type=text_to_speech`."},"custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose allowed dynamic variables are `current_phone_number`, `extension_number`, and `keypress`. `current_phone_number` announces the captured callback number; `extension_number` announces the captured extension; `keypress` announces the active keypre