h); up to 7 items per prompt.\nIn `standard` mode, supply a single item with `audio_asset_id` only.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed value: `keypress` — announces the active keypress.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"keypress","default":"keypress","enum":["keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"Repeat-the-menu keypress option. Reused by callback offer/cancel selection menus, the AMD person-answered accept menu, and the interrupt menu. In every context the repeat option is enabled by a sibling `is_repeat_option: boolean`; see the parent field for the exact enable/disable semantics."},"invalid_option":{"type":"object","properties":{"invalid_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"Message played when the consumer presses an unmapped key."},"invalid_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."},"disconnect_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"Message played before disconnecting after exceeding `repeat_limit`."},"disconnect_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."},"is_repeat":{"type":"boolean","description":"Replay the menu after an invalid keypress."},"repeat_interval":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer","description":"Seconds to wait before replaying the menu after an invalid keypress."},"repeat_limit":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of replays before disconnecting."}},"description":"Invalid-option handling for a callback selection menu. Reused by callback `menu_settings.invalid_option` and AMD `accept_menu_config.invalid_option` in both default and i18n message containers."},"retry_attempt_message":{"type":"object","properties":{"attempt_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"The message played on a retry attempt before the limit is reached."},"attempt_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose only allowed dynamic variable is `retry_attempt_number` — this announces the current callback retry attempt count.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"maxLength":36,"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed value: `retry_attempt_number`.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"retry_attempt_number","default":"retry_attempt_number","enum":["retry_attempt_number"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `retry_attempt_number`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."},"over_limit_attempt_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"The message played on the over-limit retry attempt."},"over_limit_attempt_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."},"final_attempt_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"The message played on the final retry attempt."},"final_attempt_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."}},"description":"The retry-attempt messaging for the AMD accept menu."}},"description":"Per-language messages for the AMD person-answered accept menu."}},"description":"Per-language callback messages container. Value type for both `callback_default_messages` — the default language identified by the top-level `menu_language_code` — and every entry of `callback_i18n_messages[]`. The i18n entry wraps this base with a required `lang_code` field. Inheritance: when `voice_id` or `callback_audio_type` is omitted, the value falls back to the menu container's `voice_id` / `audio_type`."},"callback_i18n_messages":{"type":"array","description":"Per-language callback message containers. The default language identified by `menu_language_code` MUST NOT appear here. Every `lang_code` present in `menu_i18n_messages` must also appear here when `request_callback` is in use.","items":{"allOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"voice_id":{"maxLength":30,"type":"string","description":"TTS actor voice ID, validated against the speakers of the resolved language for the account. Required when `audio_type` (menu) / `callback_audio_type` (callback) is `text_to_speech` — it must be one of that language's speaker IDs, otherwise HTTP 400 `ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER`. Optional when `custom_audio`. If omitted, it is stored as an empty string. On the callback container, it inherits the menu container's `voice_id` when omitted.","example":"Joanna"},"callback_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Audio mode for callback prompts. Inherits from the menu container's `audio_type` when omitted. When the effective value is `text_to_speech`, every `*_custom_audio` field on this container is ignored.","enum":["text_to_speech","custom_audio"]},"callback_returning_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"Greeting played to a returning caller who has a callback set up."},"callback_returning_message_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Custom-audio items array for fields whose only allowed dynamic variable is `keypress` (announces the active keypress to the consumer).\n\nIn `advanced` mode, each item must specify either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable` (not both); up to 7 items per prompt.\nIn `standard` mode, supply a single item with `audio_asset_id` only.","items":{"required":["order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":7,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"The order to play audio.","example":1},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset chosen to play message to consumer\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"-6y2_bOWTBixtxmNywboJg"},"audio_variable":{"type":"string","description":"Dynamic variable for advanced mode only. Allowed value: `keypress` — announces the active keypress.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"keypress","default":"keypress","enum":["keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."},"callback_confirm_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"Confirmation message played after the consumer presses `callback_confirm_keypress`."},"callback_confirm_message_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio","custom_audio_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio_type":{"type":"string","description":"Select custom audio type.\n\n-'standard' - Choose an audio file. The audio prompt must include all words, numbers, and keypress digits as part of the message. Variables cannot be used with this option.\n-'advanced' -  With this option, the audio message can be split into multiple reusable audio parts. Variables are needed. Set up the digits library before using numbers with this option.","example":"standard","default":"standard","enum":["advanced","standard"]},"custom_audio":{"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Cus