ed value: `keypress` — announces the active keypress.\n\n**Note** Provide either `audio_asset_id` or `audio_variable`, but not both.","example":"keypress","default":"keypress","enum":["keypress"]}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt. Allowed `audio_variable`: `keypress`. Pairs an audio mode `custom_audio_type` with one to seven audio items `custom_audio[]`. Honored when the surrounding `audio_type` or `callback_audio_type` is `custom_audio`; ignored when it is `text_to_speech`."}},"description":"Repeat-the-menu keypress option. Reused by callback offer/cancel selection menus, the AMD person-answered accept menu, and the interrupt menu. In every context the repeat option is enabled by a sibling `is_repeat_option: boolean`; see the parent field for the exact enable/disable semantics."}},"description":"Callback offer selection menu prompts and keypress options. Each `menu_action` value in `callback_keypresses[]` MUST appear at most once; duplicate values are rejected server-side with HTTP 400."},"callback_cancel_menu":{"type":"object","properties":{"greeting_message":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string","description":"Greeting played at the start of the cancel selection menu."},"greeting_custom_audio":{"required":["custom_audio"],"type":"object","properties":{"custom_audio":{"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"type":"array","description":"Single audio item. `standard` mode disallows multiple items and disallows `audio_variable`.","items":{"required":["audio_asset_id","order"],"type":"object","properties":{"order":{"maximum":1,"minimum":1,"type":"integer","description":"Always `1`."},"audio_asset_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the audio asset to play."}}}}},"description":"Pre-recorded audio prompt restricted to `standard` mode — supply exactly one audio item with `audio_asset_id`; dynamic `audio_variable` is not supported here."},"callback_keypresses":{"maxItems":2,"type":"array","description":"Per-keypress configuration for the cancel selection menu. Each `menu_